  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Mollusk (Deaner on drums/Claude on guitar)** (1 other source): Deaner played drums and Claude played guitar on this song, per the track listing [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **audience**: rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2008-07-12.core** (recommended): source not stated; 32 songs; 183 min [1]\n- **ween2008-07-12**: source not stated; 32 songs; 183 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2008-07-12.core**: taped by Chris King; transferred by Chris King; source: Core Sound Mic Core In Line Pre amp > M-audio1 (24/96) [1]. Also: Recorded with a Core Sound microphone into a Core in-line preamp, then an M-Audio interface at 24-bit/96kHz; Transferred via CF card, dithered to 16/44 with dBpoweramp, then processed in CDWav and encoded to FLAC level 8 [1]\n- **ween2008-07-12**: taped by Chris King; transferred by Chris King; source: Church-Audio STC-11> Church-Audio ST-9100 > M-audio (24/96) [2]",
